{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00414",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 2.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Hello. Right, let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.0,
      "end_seconds": 3.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.24,
      "end_seconds": 8.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Okay, what was the main thing you wanted to talk about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.11,
      "end_seconds": 19.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "I've been getting breathless walking short distances, and I wanted to get it checked. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.92,
      "end_seconds": 27.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.66,
      "end_seconds": 38.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "I notice it more with walking uphill. Only stopping to rest, and it's not much. I'd say severe. I'd say a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.81,
      "end_seconds": 41.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.37,
      "end_seconds": 47.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "It usually comes with a feeling that I can't take a deep breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.31,
      "end_seconds": 50.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Any occasional wheeze as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.05,
      "end_seconds": 74.32,
      "duration_seconds": 23.27,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, that too. As for occasional wheeze, I'd say mild. As for feeling that I can't take a deep breath, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Yeah, with feeling that I can't take a deep breath, moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.52,
      "end_seconds": 79.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.83,
      "end_seconds": 80.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.29,
      "end_seconds": 97.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any chest pain, weight loss or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.39,
      "end_seconds": 100.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.81,
      "end_seconds": 108.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.93,
      "end_seconds": 122.56,
      "duration_seconds": 13.63,
      "text": "Um, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.32,
      "end_seconds": 124.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.48,
      "end_seconds": 126.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.65,
      "end_seconds": 130.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.5,
      "end_seconds": 133.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.36,
      "end_seconds": 136.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.21,
      "end_seconds": 139.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.9,
      "end_seconds": 143.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.47,
      "end_seconds": 147.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No problem, um, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.0,
      "end_seconds": 152.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.92,
      "end_seconds": 156.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.4,
      "end_seconds": 174.11,
      "duration_seconds": 16.71,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.21,
      "end_seconds": 177.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.2,
      "end_seconds": 181.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.52,
      "end_seconds": 190.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had COPD, yes. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.68,
      "end_seconds": 194.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Okay, COPD, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.61,
      "end_seconds": 198.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.04,
      "end_seconds": 199.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.63,
      "end_seconds": 213.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.03,
      "end_seconds": 221.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Yeah, just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.2,
      "end_seconds": 226.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.7,
      "end_seconds": 228.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.19,
      "end_seconds": 231.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.85,
      "end_seconds": 246.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.14,
      "end_seconds": 255.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.6,
      "end_seconds": 259.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.92,
      "end_seconds": 279.08,
      "duration_seconds": 18.16,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been getting breathless walking short distances, severe, and no weight loss or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.35,
      "end_seconds": 281.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.06,
      "end_seconds": 295.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.34,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.69,
      "end_seconds": 298.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.46,
      "end_seconds": 323.01,
      "duration_seconds": 23.55,
      "text": "We should do an echocardiogram for breathlessness. Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. I'd like you to see a chest physician as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.52,
      "end_seconds": 324.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.18,
      "end_seconds": 329.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.15,
      "end_seconds": 334.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.05,
      "end_seconds": 340.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.35,
      "end_seconds": 343.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}